<title>POLAND: Exbud wins 8.9 Ecu railway contract.</title>
<headline>Exbud wins 8.9 Ecu railway contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Exbud SA has signed a contract with Polish state-owned PKP railways for the modernisation of a railway station, Exbud said in a statement.</p>
<p>Exbud said work on the project would take place from April this year to February 1998.</p>
<p>(( -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700 ))</p>
